    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Avard became a vital transportation center after the Frisco Railroad extended through the area in 1904.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://unitedstatesghosttowns.com/avard-oklahoma-ghost-town/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Avard prospered as an agricultural hub until the Great Depression and Dust Bowl caused severe economic devastation.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
