      ],
      "source": "https://unitedstatesghosttowns.com/avard-oklahoma-ghost-town/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Abandoned buildings, including the historic gym and the Avard Tribune office, now characterize the town's landscape.",
